Tom: I''ve decided to study agriculture.
Lucy: Agriculture? That''s not a common choice. Why?
Tom: My grandparents are farmers, and I grew up in the fields.
Lucy: So you really love working the land.
Tom: I do. And I want to help farmers grow more food.
Lucy: Like Yuan Longping, the father of hybrid rice?
Tom: Exactly. He is the reason I want to do this.', 'Lucy 问 Tom 想上大学读什么;Tom 决定学农业;因为祖父母是农民,他在田里长大,真心热爱耕作;他想帮农民种出更多粮食;像杂交水稻之父袁隆平那样,袁隆平正是他立志学农的原因。', 'uk_female', '[{"q":"What does Tom want to study?","type":"choice","answer":"A","options":["Agriculture.","Medicine.","Music.","History."]},{"q":"Why is Tom interested in this subject?","type":"choice","answer":"B","options":["His friends told him to.","He grew up in the fields with farming grandparents.","He wants to leave the countryside.","He thinks it is the easiest subject."]},{"q":"What does Tom hope to do in the future?","type":"choice","answer":"A","options":["Help farmers grow more food.","Stop all farming.","Sell his family''s land.","Move far away from farms."]},{"q":"Who does Tom mention as his model?","type":"choice","answer":"B","options":["A famous singer.","Yuan Longping.","A football player.","His school teacher."]},{"q":"How does Lucy feel about Tom''s choice at first?","type":"choice","answer":"C","options":["She thinks it is boring.","She thinks it is wrong.","She thinks it is an unusual choice.","She is angry about it."]}]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, 'long', 'elective1', 'U5');
About one in ten people on the planet does not get enough food.
Wars can heavily affect how food is grown and moved.
Many poor families simply cannot afford to eat well.
Helping farmers grow more food is one important way to fight hunger.', '如今世界饥饿仍是严重问题;地球上约十分之一的人吃不饱;战争会严重影响粮食的种植和运输;许多贫困家庭根本吃不起好的食物;帮助农民种出更多粮食是抗击饥饿的重要途径之一。', 'uk_female', '[{"q":"What does the speaker say about world hunger?","type":"choice","answer":"D","options":["It has completely ended.","It only happens in cities.","It is no longer studied.","It is still a serious problem today."]},{"q":"About how many people do not get enough food?","type":"choice","answer":"A","options":["About one in ten people.","None at all.","Everyone on the planet.","Only farmers."]},{"q":"How can wars affect food, according to the passage?","type":"choice","answer":"B","options":["They make food cheaper.","They affect how food is grown and moved.","They have no effect on food.","They only help farmers."]},{"q":"Why can''t many poor families eat well?","type":"choice","answer":"C","options":["They dislike all food.","They grow too much food.","They cannot afford good food.","They live far from cities."]},{"q":"What is one important way to fight hunger?","type":"choice","answer":"D","options":["Stop all farming.","Close all the markets.","Move everyone to the city.","Help farmers grow more food."]}]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, 'short', 'elective1', 'U5');
Ben: Why? The cheaper ones look just as good.
Anna: Organic food is grown without chemical pesticides.
Ben: Does that really make a difference?
Anna: Yes. Chemicals can stay in the soil and even in the food.
Ben: I see. So organic food may be safer for us.
Anna: That''s right. It often has more flavour too.
Ben: All right, I''ll try the organic ones this time.', 'Anna 宁愿买稍贵的有机苹果;Ben 不解,觉得便宜的看着一样好;Anna 解释有机食品不用化学杀虫剂;化学品会残留在土壤甚至食物中;有机食品对人更安全,味道往往也更好;Ben 决定这次也试试有机的。', 'uk_female', '[{"q":"Which apples does Anna decide to buy?","type":"choice","answer":"A","options":["The organic ones.","The cheapest ones.","No apples at all.","The biggest ones."]},{"q":"How is organic food grown?","type":"choice","answer":"B","options":["With many chemicals.","Without chemical pesticides.","Only in salty land.","Without any soil."]},{"q":"Why does Anna think chemicals are a problem?","type":"choice","answer":"C","options":["They make food cheaper.","They help every insect.","They can stay in the soil and food.","They have no effect at all."]},{"q":"What does Anna say about the flavour of organic food?","type":"choice","answer":"D","options":["It tastes worse.","It has no taste.","It tastes the same.","It often has more flavour."]},{"q":"What does Ben decide at the end?","type":"choice","answer":"A","options":["To try the organic apples this time.","To buy no fruit.","To grow his own apples.","To buy the cheapest ones."]}]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, 'long', 'elective1', 'U5');
He developed the first hybrid rice that farmers could really use.
His new rice gave a much higher yield than older crops.
Even after he grew rich, he still lived like a simple farmer.
His dream was to keep all people away from hunger.', '袁隆平一生都在耕耘土地;他培育出第一种农民真正能用的杂交水稻;新稻的产量远高于旧作物;即使富有了,他仍像普通农民一样生活;他的梦想是让所有人远离饥饿。', 'uk_female', '[{"q":"What did Yuan Longping spend his whole life doing?","type":"choice","answer":"B","options":["Travelling the world.","Working the land.","Selling chemicals.","Teaching music."]},{"q":"What did Yuan develop?","type":"choice","answer":"C","options":["A new kind of car.","A chemical pesticide.","The first usable hybrid rice.","A city farm."]},{"q":"How did his new rice compare with older crops?","type":"choice","answer":"D","options":["It gave less food.","It was exactly the same.","It could not be eaten.","It gave a much higher yield."]},{"q":"How did Yuan live after he grew rich?","type":"choice","answer":"A","options":["He still lived like a simple farmer.","He moved to another country.","He stopped all his work.","He became very lazy."]},{"q":"What was Yuan''s dream?","type":"choice","answer":"B","options":["To become the richest man.","To keep all people away from hunger.","To stop growing rice.","To leave the countryside."]}]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, 'short', 'elective1', 'U5');
Kate: Of course, Grandpa. What do you need me to do?
Grandpa: We need to change the crop in the east field.
Kate: Why do we change it every year?
Grandpa: Different crops put different minerals back into the soil.
Kate: So that keeps the land rich and healthy.
Grandpa: Exactly. Last year we grew wheat, so this year we''ll grow beans.
Kate: I understand now. Farming takes real care.', '爷爷请 Kate 周末到田里帮忙;Kate 答应,问要做什么;爷爷说要给东边那块地换种作物;Kate 问为什么每年都换;因为不同作物把不同矿物质还回土壤,使土地保持肥沃健康;去年种小麦,今年种豆子;Kate 明白了:务农需要真正的用心。', 'uk_female', '[{"q":"What does Grandpa ask Kate to do?","type":"choice","answer":"C","options":["Cook dinner for him.","Clean the house.","Help him in the fields.","Sell the farm."]},{"q":"What job needs doing in the east field?","type":"choice","answer":"D","options":["Building a new house.","Cutting down trees.","Selling the soil.","Changing the crop."]},{"q":"Why does Grandpa change the crop every year?","type":"choice","answer":"A","options":["Because different crops return different minerals to the soil.","Because he is bored.","Because the field is too small.","Because beans are cheap."]},{"q":"What did they grow last year, and what now?","type":"choice","answer":"B","options":["Rice last year, corn now.","Wheat last year, beans now.","Beans last year, wheat now.","Corn last year, rice now."]},{"q":"What does Kate learn from the talk?","type":"choice","answer":"C","options":["Farming is very easy.","Farming needs many chemicals.","Farming takes real care.","Farming is a waste of time."]}]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, 'long', 'elective1', 'U5');
It is celebrated in more than one hundred and fifty countries.
The day reminds people of the problems of hunger and poverty.
Schools often hold activities to teach students about food.
Its message is simple: no one in the world should go hungry.', '世界粮食日每年十月举行;在一百五十多个国家庆祝;这一天提醒人们关注饥饿与贫困问题;学校常举办活动让学生了解粮食;它的信息很简单:世界上不该有人挨饿。', 'uk_female', '[{"q":"When is World Food Day held?","type":"choice","answer":"D","options":["Every week.","Only once in history.","Every day.","Every year in October."]},{"q":"In how many countries is it celebrated?","type":"choice","answer":"A","options":["In more than one hundred and fifty countries.","In just one country.","In no countries.","Only in schools."]},{"q":"What does the day remind people of?","type":"choice","answer":"B","options":["The price of cars.","The problems of hunger and poverty.","The latest films.","The weather in summer."]},{"q":"What do schools often do on this day?","type":"choice","answer":"C","options":["Close for a holiday.","Sell food to visitors.","Hold activities to teach students about food.","Forget about the day."]},{"q":"What is the message of World Food Day?","type":"choice","answer":"D","options":["Food should be very expensive.","Only farmers matter.","Hunger cannot be solved.","No one should go hungry."]}]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, 'short', 'elective1', 'U5');

